[Options]

[A.]
<h2>~[IbombSpecialOne.*]~kKill ~wthe ~kGuards ~wof ~kDeath</h2>
<i>"No one gets the Watchman"<br>
--TheSecondGuard</i>  
<p>Now it's time to kill the ~rWatchman.
<p>~.You may need to kill a guard to get to him but you don't have to.

<$PlaySound, eagleScream.wav>
$Button=stuff,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Kill him!,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][ai2PriestDead]
<h2>The Wathman is dead!</h2>
<p>
You've just killed the coward now kill ~kDeath ~tStar

<$PlaySound, upgradeDone.wav>
<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,attackds

[ai3PriestDead]
<h2>Guard 1 Down!</h2>
<p>Kill the ~rWatchman ~.now

[ai4PriestDead]
<h2>Guard 2 Down!</h2>
<p>Kill the ~rWatchman ~.now

[@300]
<h2>Kill that ~rWatchman!</h2>
<p>~.You don't have to kill the guards you know

[@1200]
<h2>Come On!</h2>
How long does take you to ------ Kill him!

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
The Guards have killed you! WOW!
R.I.P. or give it another shot!

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[END]
